```console
$ scherzo-cloud connection linear authorization --help
Manage Linear authorization sessions

Usage: scherzo-cloud connection linear authorization [COMMAND]

Commands:
  create  Create a Linear authorization session
  show    Show an authorization session
  wait    Wait for an authorization session
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
